  "_comment": "Expected-support matrix for access_mode=plain (Glue/Hive catalog, runtime-role IAM, no Lake Formation). States: S=supported, S3=supported but needs direct S3 IAM, N=not supported (a failure here is expected behaviour, not a regression).",
